{"seq":6,"slug":"controversies-and-appraisal","title":"保罗·格雷厄姆·争议与评价","stage":"DONE","category":"paul-graham","categoryLabel":"保罗·格雷厄姆","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/controversies-and-appraisal","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.2,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/08_paul-graham/6_controversies-and-appraisal","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"争议与评价\">争议与评价</h1><p>衡量一个公共人物，颂词最廉价，逐项的较真最稀缺。本卷不替保罗·格雷厄姆辩护，也不为批评他而批评，而是把围绕他的真实争议一件件摊到台面上，标明时间、原话、批评者与反驳，再判断每项主张究竟站得住到什么程度。</p>\n<p>具体而言，本卷会处理这些有据可查的事件与论战：2013 年他称浓重外国口音是 CEO 的&quot;糟糕信号&quot;所引发的&quot;口音门&quot;；2014 年关于女性程序员&quot;问题在上游十年&quot;的言论；2016 年随笔《Economic Inequality》引爆的不平等与精英主义大论战——他被批为财富集中辩护，他则称自己只反对欺诈致富而非创富；YC 规模化十年增长约十倍后&quot;喷洒式投资、质量稀释&quot;的指控，以及数据给出的复杂反驳；他随笔风格被批&quot;格言化、过度简化、幸存者偏差&quot;，乃至近年《The Origins of Wokeness》把他推上政治论战的风口。</p>\n<p>本卷分三章递进。第一章直面引发众怒的言论与不平等之争；第二章处理两场更结构化的辩论——YC 模式的规模化批评，以及随笔风格的洞见与简化之争；第三章做总账，清算&quot;创业教父&quot;光环的真实基础与它的代价，并在思想影响力与争议之间给出一个不回避、可分级的最终定位。</p>\n<p>读完本卷你会发现：格雷厄姆的影响力与争议往往同源于一种性格——敢把未打磨的判断当勇敢直言发布。理解这一点，比给他贴上&quot;先知&quot;或&quot;歧视者&quot;的标签，更接近真实，也更有用。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"controversies","title":"争议","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"provocative-essays","title":"招致众怒的随笔与言论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/provocative-essays"},{"seq":2,"slug":"inequality-and-elitism","title":"《经济不平等》引爆的论战","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/controversies-and-appraisal/controversies/inequality-and-elitism"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"debates","title":"思想的争论","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/controversies-and-appraisal/debates","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"yc-model-critiques","title":"规模化之后的 YC：稀释还是进化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/yc-model-critiques"},{"seq":2,"slug":"overstated-or-not","title":"随笔的风格之争：洞见还是格言化简化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/controversies-and-appraisal/debates/overstated-or-not"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"overall-appraisal","title":"综合评价","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-startup-guru","title":"\"创业教父\"的光环与它的代价","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/the-startup-guru"},{"seq":2,"slug":"a-balanced-assessment","title":"一份不回避争议的总账","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/controversies-and-appraisal/overall-appraisal/a-balanced-assessment"}]}]}